# Push skill changes

If you change files under `neoag-skills/`, `neoag-basic-tools-install/`, or `neoag-basic-tools-run/` (including `SKILL.md`, scripts, docs):

1. Commit on the current branch with a message that states **why**.
2. `git push` to the tracked remote (`origin`). Do not wait for a second “push” request.
3. Do not `--no-verify`, do not force-push `main`/`master`.
4. After push, give the remote URL / commit.

This overrides “only commit when asked” **for these skills only**. Other repos still need an explicit commit request.
